# Build context allowlist (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Only what the image needs: never ship packs, mask stores, keys, caches or tests.
*
!pyproject.toml
!requirements/service-cuda.txt
!README.md
!src/
!deploy/docker/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/docker/healthcheck.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
